<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS NET BUYERS OF S.AFRICA SHARES LAST WEEK.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS NET BUYERS OF S.AFRICA SHARES LAST WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock</p>
<p>Exchange (JSE) said non-residents were net buyers of shares on</p>
<p>the exchange last week.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand) -</p>
<p>			  Week to Sept 6  Year to date  Year ago	</p>
<p>Equities:</p>
<p>- purchases		     536.33  28,410.2	16,725.3</p>
<p>- sales			   449.03  22,999.2	12,805.8</p>
<p>- net purchases/(sales)	87.29   5,411.0	 3,919.5</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures reflect only the portion of the market</p>
<p>where non-resident transactions are executed through the JSE,</p>
<p>and are therefore not comprehensive.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
